              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man en tic ame jo me doggola a Merari bino tiyo i kema me rwatte; dok Itamar wot alamdog Aron, en a bino loyo ticgi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
